{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/label_108.json","id":292067,"nhanesId":"","bundleName":"","fullName":"Collagen Beauty","brandName":"Irwin Naturals","brandIpSymbol":"®","upcSku":"7 10363 59212 7","productVersionCode":"8296-LAB-IN039212-V4-07/20","pdf":"292067_document.pdf","thumbnail":"292067_thumbnail.jpg","servingsPerContainer":"13","hasOuterCarton":null,"percentDvFootnote":"% Daily Value based on a 2,000 calorie diet","labelRelationships":[{"type":"Image difference, same product","labelId":256487}],"contacts":[{"contactId":1418,"text":"Distributed, Formulated and Quality Tested by","types":["Manufacturer","Distributor"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_1.json","id":1418,"name":"Irwin Naturals","streetAddress":"5310 Beethoven Street","city":"Los Angeles","state":"CA","country":"","zipCode":"90066","phoneNumber":"1-800-297-3273","email":"Questions@IrwinNaturals.com","webAddress":"www.IrwinNaturals.com"}}],"netContents":[{"order":1,"quantity":80,"unit":"Liquid Softgel(s)","display":"80 Liquid Softgel(s)"}],"physicalState":{"langualCode":"E0161","langualCodeDescription":"Softgel Capsule"},"servingSizes":[{"order":1,"minQuantity":6,"maxQuantity":6,"minDailyServings":1,"maxDailyServings":1,"unit":"Liquid Softgel(s)","notes":"","inSFB":true}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)","Women (not pregnant or lactating)"],"productType":{"langualCode":"A1317","langualCodeDescription":"Botanical with Nutrients"},"statements":[{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Collagen is a complex structural protein that gives strength, elasticity and protection to the skin, while helping to retain moisture within the deep dermal layers."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"As we age, the rate of collagen production decreases in our body. This decrease in collagen production is believed to be one of the primary reasons for the development of fine lines, wrinkles and dryness of skin.\r\nBoost collagen production with Collagen Beauty."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"This deep-acting formula features Verisol to help combat the effects of aging by delivering the building blocks needed to revitalize the skin and boost your body's collagen production.\r\nCollagen Beauty delivers nourishment for your skin and nails, including 2,500 mg of Verisol Collagen Peptides, Biotin, Gotu Kola, antioxidants such as CoQ10 and Resveratrol, as well as a variety of nourishing Omega oils including Moroccoan Argan oil and Apricot Kernel oil."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"What makes us different:\r\nLiquid soft-gels\r\nThe nutrients in these easy-to-swallow liquid soft-gels are released fast. Other forms of delivery can contain binders and fillers that may cause stomach upset and offer no nutritional value. Advanced liquid soft-gels provide an optimum delivery system."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food & Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Global Responsibility\r\nOver the years we have donated to organizations that support the environment and the health of our children."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Patented BioPerine\r\nOur special BioPerine Complex enhances the bioavailability, absorption and potency of many nutrients."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Usage warnings: Do not use if safety seal is broken.\r\nDo not exceed recommended daily intake."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Check with your doctor before using this product if you are using medication or have any medical conditions. Do not use if you may become pregnant, are pregnant or nursing."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Not intended for use by persons under 18. Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Questions: Contact Consumer Affairs\r\n1-800-297-3273\r\nWeekdays: 8:00 AM to 5:00 PM (PST)\r\nQuestions@IrwinNaturals.com\r\n100+ Highly specialized products\r\nwww.Irwinnaturals.com"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Clinically proven Verisol\r\nPlus nourishing omega oils"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Fine lines & wrinkles\r\nPowerful formula to help combat fine lines and wrinkles, improve skin appearance and strengthen nails"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: (Adult) Take six (6) liquid soft-gels per day with meals and full glass (8oz) of water. May be taken all at once or divided throughout the day."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains: Soy, Tree nuts (coconut, palm kernel)"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"BioPerine is a registered trademark of Sabinsa Corporation.\r\nVerisol is a registered trademark of GELITA AG."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No preservatives added."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"This product can be used daily to improve skin appearance and strengthen nails."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Pass\r\nQuality tested guaranteed"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Quality assurance\r\nIrwin Naturals is committed to providing the highest quality products for your health. We employ compliance testing to ensure purity and potency."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Full disclosure ingredient panel"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2023-06-22","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCo